            <description><![CDATA[New optional setting "Catch the start of calls" (Settings, Advanced, off by default): when a call is detected Corder can quietly buffer it from the start, so accepting the record offer keeps the beginning. Declining discards it. Also: the menu-bar popover now reliably closes when you click outside it.]]></description>
